flowchart TD
  User[Human or coding assistant] --> CLI[RAMsey CLI]
  User --> Onboard[One-time onboard]
  Onboard --> Launch[Owned login LaunchAgent / five minutes]
  Launch --> Pressure[Short native pressure check / no resident model]
  Pressure --> Status[Private latest state / status and local notices]
  CLI --> Native[Native Mac reads / fixed commands]
  Native --> Evidence[CPU intervals / RSS groups / work / capacity / energy]
  Evidence --> Local[Private bounded history and comparisons]
  Evidence --> Advice[One evidence-based next step]
  Advice --> Coordinator[Assistant coordinates explicit handoff]
  Coordinator --> QuickSilver[QuickSilver / measure one bottleneck / smallest fix]
  QuickSilver --> Proof[Same-workload before and after / latency proof]
  Proof --> Local
  QuickSilver --> Approval[Production deployment requires approval]
  Native -. unavailable .-> Unknown[Unknown stays unknown / no app control]
